<title>POLAND: CHEMISKOR MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>CHEMISKOR MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.89 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.45 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.43 vs   0.09</p>
<p> Sales		    1.59 vs   1.29</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.46 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.35 vs   0.31</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.65 vs   0.35</p>
<p> Sales		    4.59 vs   3.43</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish leather maker is Chemiskor SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
